/* ── 预设话术编辑（管理员账号密码验证，无本地会话，每次操作都重新校验） ── */
var _chatEditCred = null;
function openChatEditModal(){
  document.getElementById('chat-edit-overlay').classList.add('open');
  document.getElementById('cem-login').style.display = '';
  document.getElementById('cem-editor').style.display = 'none';
  document.getElementById('cem-err').textContent = '';
  document.getElementById('cem-user').value = '';
  document.getElementById('cem-pass').value = '';
  setTimeout(function(){ try{ document.getElementById('cem-user').focus(); }catch(e){} }, 100);
